It is built from openvinotoolkit/openvino.genai at tag 2026.4.1.0 (commit ab01d1771e4) with the changes in
openvino-genai-castellan.patch, made by Castellan in October 2026, which changes one file,
src/cpp/src/visual_language/pipeline.cpp:

1. A non-chat generate() resets the inputs embedder's cache state when it starts, so a request that failed
   part-way no longer makes every later request fail its tokenized history check.
2. On NPU, a text-only prompt's one-element visual_pos_masks (Qwen3-VL) is widened to the whole prompt, all
   false, because NPUW's chunked prefill slices it along the prompt.

